@startuml
title Green Rides UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Login

state Login
Login : entry / user should be registered
Login : do / user provide Login Details
Login : exit / login Successful

state JourneyDetails
JourneyDetails : entry / user selects destination
JourneyDetails : do / system displays journey details
JourneyDetails : exit / user chooses driving mode or other options

state EatSelection
EatSelection : entry / user is hungry
EatSelection : do / user selects a place to eat
EatSelection : exit / user views menu and places order if needed

state Accident
Accident : entry / accident occurs
Accident : do / system informs relevant authorities
Accident : exit / notifications sent during driving or in case of an accident

state Feedback
Feedback : entry / journey completed
Feedback : do / user provides feedback
Feedback : exit / process ends
@enduml
